led", "name": "Controlled", "html": "<div><div class=\"ODSRow\" style=\"justify-content: center; width: 30rem; max-width: 100%; margin: auto; padding: 3rem 0px;\"><div class=\"ODSColumn\" style=\"gap: 1rem;\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePicker ODSTimePicker--size-large\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePickerInputField ODSTimePickerInputField--status-filled\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePickerInputField-Content ODSTimePickerInputField-Content--size-large\"><label class=\"ODSTimePickerInputField-Label ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--size-large ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--status-filled ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--mode-standard\" for=\"_r_3_\">Time</label><input id=\"_r_3_\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"HH:mm\" aria-label=\"Time\" class=\"ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--status-filled ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--mode-standard ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--size-large\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"text\" value=\"23:04\"><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-large ODSButton--buttonType-iconOnly ODSButton--variant-ghost ODSTimePickerInputField-TimePickerAction ODSTimePickerInputField-TimePickerAction--size-large ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-ghost ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-iconOnly ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-large\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Change time 23:04\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><div class=\"ODSRow ODSButton-Content ODSButton-Content--size-large ODSButton-Content--buttonType-iconOnly\"><svg class=\"ODSIcon ODSButton-ButtonIcon ODSButton-ButtonIcon--size-large ODSButton-ButtonIcon--buttonType-iconOnly ODSButton-ButtonIcon--variant-ghost\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><g><path d=\"M13 7a1 1 0 1 0-2 0v5a1 1 0 0 0 .293.707l3 3a1 1 0 0 0 1.414-1.414L13 11.586z\"></path><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2M4 12a8 8 0 1 1 16 0 8 8 0 0 1-16 0\"></path></g></g></svg></div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ODSRow\" style=\"gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-small ODSButton--buttonType-standard ODSButton--variant-outline ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-outline ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-standard ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-small\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Now\" aria-busy=\"false\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><div class=\"ODSRow ODSButton-Content ODSButton-Content--size-small ODSButton-Content--buttonType-standard\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"ODSButton-Label\">Now</span></div></button><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-small ODSButton--buttonType-standard ODSButton--variant-outline ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-outline ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-standard ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-small\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"+1 hour\" aria-busy=\"false\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><div class=\"ODSRow ODSButton-Content ODSButton-Content--size-small ODSButton-Content--buttonType-standard\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"ODSButton-Label\">+1 hour</span></div></button><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-small ODSButton--buttonType-standard ODSButton--variant-ghost ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-ghost ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-standard ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-small\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear\" aria-busy=\"false\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><div class=\"ODSRow ODSButton-Content ODSButton-Content--size-small ODSButton-Content--buttonType-standard\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"ODSButton-Label\">Clear</span></div></button></div><i>The selected time is controlled by the parent. Use the buttons to set it programmatica