-rule=\"evenodd\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2M4 12a8 8 0 1 1 16 0 8 8 0 0 1-16 0\"></path></g></g></svg></div></button></div></div></div><i>The flyout open state is controlled by the parent. Use the buttons to open/close it programmatically. Clicking the input, selecting a time, or pressing Escape fires onOpen/onClose, which update the controlled state.</i></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "components-timepicker--informative", "name": "Informative", "html": "<div><div class=\"ODSRow\" style=\"justify-content: center; width: 30rem; max-width: 100%; margin: auto; padding: 3rem 0px;\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePicker ODSTimePicker--size-large\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePickerInputField ODSTimePickerInputField--status-editing\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSTimePickerInputField-Content ODSTimePickerInputField-Content--size-large\"><label class=\"ODSTimePickerInputField-Label ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--size-large ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--status-editing ODSTimePickerInputField-Label--mode-informative\" for=\"_r_3_\">Time</label><input id=\"_r_3_\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"HH:mm\" aria-label=\"Time\" class=\"ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--status-editing ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--mode-informative ODSTimePickerInputField-InputField--size-large\" aria-invalid=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"_r_3_-support-message\" autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-large ODSButton--buttonType-iconOnly ODSButton--variant-ghost ODSTimePickerInputField-TimePickerAction ODSTimePickerInputField-TimePickerAction--size-large ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-ghost ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-iconOnly ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-large\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Select time\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><